            "notes": "[Video Link (1:03)](https://youtu.be/1uZjlqJzVTY?si=J255INIA0lvPR0Qq&t=63)\n\n### Power\nDon't start with [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d), more value taking [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) early rounds, especially against the specific comp in the video.\n\n### Items\n* [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n* [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7)\n* [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)",
