            "notes": "[Video Link (5:49)](https://youtu.be/1uZjlqJzVTY?si=ywikpUXu7ajrcPMB&t=349)\n\n### Power\nPick up [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) for this round. \n\n### Playstyle\nAt the beginning of the round, prime your output in spawn by using just under half your Biotic Energy and using a damaging [Biotic Orb](ability_721997d0-c151-4a4c-bb11-86552b14def6). This will allow [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) to fire much quicker and ensure a damage orb is fired. \n\n[Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) is basically required to maintain uptime of [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) without relying on Biotic Grasp Secondary Fire. Instead, you refill your Biotic Energy every time you fade, which works well with [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb). This is especially important in the video due to the long range nature of the map and enemy team. \n\n### Items\n* [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) - Attack Speed, Ability Power, refill Biotic Energy on fade for more [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) procs.\n* [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) - Orbs damage enemies more, leading to more damage and more Ability Lifesteal.\n* [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) - Attack Speed means we use Biotic Energy faster leading to more [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) orb generation. \n* [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) - Called out as good against the Cassidy, and Arx was 300 cash short of affording [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6), which he may have kept instead for general armor.",
