            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-25T22:31:48.79876+00:00",
            "notes": "[Video Link (11:21)](https://youtu.be/1uZjlqJzVTY?si=cQTkhmLDMCwPTCz0&t=681)\n\n### Power\nOur Power this round is [Deconstruction](item_cc8c46cc-b4a3-4c0f-aeb6-f7837e0e8e7c) which synergizes with [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d). When we use our Biotic Energy, we also trigger a damage bonus that will apply to the orb just fired and any other damage dealt for 6s. I sampled the round footage and for a 1 minute section, **damage was boosted ~74% of the time** (about 44 seconds during the 1 minute clip). \n\n### Playstyle\nGiven the money Arx had in the video, he opted for both debuff items and sold [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) to afford it. He picks it back up in the following round, but between [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb), [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d), and the general [Biotic Orb](ability_721997d0-c151-4a4c-bb11-86552b14def6), there's a lot of orbs applying debuffs. \n\nAbility Power is still average here, so orbs are not as good as they will get, but the double debuff this round is worth it. \n\n### Items\n* [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) - Slowing the enemy team, affecting their positioning and movement, especially impactful against Genji, Junker Queen, and Brigitte. \n* [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) - Limit the effectiveness of healing, especially impactful against Junker Queen, and Brigitte. \n\n### Sell\n* [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) - Selling in favor of getting both [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) and [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) to have greater impact on the team, limiting the movement of Junker Queen, Brigitte, and Genji, and the healing of Junker Queen and Brigitte. \n* [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) - No longer needed.",
