            "notes": "[Video Link (16:01)](https://youtu.be/1uZjlqJzVTY?si=16orjUUYuKhzb-oy&t=961)\n\n### Playstyle\nThe primary focus of these items is to apply as many debuffs as possible to slow and reduce healing. [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) and [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) will be doing a lot of the work, but aiming orbs and our healing-triggered [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) orbs to maximize bouncing off walls and around corners will maximize our damage and debuff output. \n\n### Items\n* [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) - Buying this back with the new money, still a huge value in the late game. \n* [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) - Increasing orb range increases debuff application, Ability Damage output, and health restored by Ability Lifesteal. \n* [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) - Adds Ability Lifesteal, which with the volume of orbs will be substantial. \n\n### Sell\n* [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) - Finally replacing this with Epic items. \n* [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) - Upgrading to [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) for Ability Lifesteal. \n* [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) - Small hit to our Attack Speed, but totally worth the slot.",
